      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a prospective study, the regional ventricular function was assessed by cross sectional echocardiography in 22 patients with coronary heart disease. When compared with angiocardiography, cross sectional echocardiography has proven to be a valuable tool for the evaluation of regional ventricular function."},
